Relevant columns and their potential usage  
• "DATE_VALID_STD": filters the calendar days that make‑up the required week in the prior year (2023‑01‑16 … 2023‑01‑22).  
• "POSTAL_CODE": identifies the U.S. ZIP code for which snowfall is reported – needed in SELECT list and GROUP / ORDER clauses.  
• "COUNTRY": allows us to keep only United States rows ("US").  
• "TOT_SNOWFALL_IN": daily total snowfall (inches) – use for the > 6‑inch filter and for reporting / aggregation.  
• "DOY_STD": optional helper column for day‑of‑year logic (DOY 16‑22 for 2023).  

